# Zombie Extraction Game - AI Instructions

## Project Context

This is a **single-file Phaser 3 game** (`game.html`, ~9200 lines). All game logic, configuration, and scenes are contained in one HTML file with embedded JavaScript.

**Current Build**: v0.6.0 (Multiplayer)  
**Save Version**: v17

