- Host-authority model: host runs game, guest receives state
- Room codes for matchmaking (4 alphanumeric characters)
- Downed/revive mechanic (30s bleedout, 3s revive)
- Difficulty scaling: +25% enemies, +30% enemy HP

**Separate Files:**
- `game.html` - Single-player version (v0.5.1)
