## Multiplayer Technical Reference (game_multiplayer.html)

### Server Setup (`server/` folder)
```
server/
├── server.js      - WebSocket server (Node.js + ws library)
├── package.json   - Dependencies
├── Dockerfile     - Docker deployment
├── railway.json   - Railway deployment
└── render.yaml    - Render deployment
```

**Run locally:** `cd server && npm install && npm start`  
**Default port:** 3000 (or process.env.PORT)

### Core Classes & Functions

#### MultiplayerManager (~line 2085-2350)
```javascript
// Create/join rooms
mp.createRoom()              // Host creates room, gets roomCode
mp.joinRoom(code)            // Guest joins with code

// Communication
mp.sendGameState(state)      // Host broadcasts state
mp.sendInput(input)          // Guest sends input to host
mp.sendGameEvent(event)      // Both - generic events

// Callbacks (set these before use)
mp.onRoomCreated = (roomCode) => {}
mp.onRoomJoined = () => {}
mp.onPlayerJoined = () => {}
mp.onGameState = (state) => {}
mp.onPlayerInput = (input) => {}
mp.onGameEvent = (event) => {}
mp.onHostDisconnected = () => {}
mp.onPlayerDisconnected = () => {}
```

#### SeededRandom (~line 1064-1083)
```javascript
mpRandom = new SeededRandom(seed)  // Initialize with level number
mpRandom.next()                    // Returns 0-1 float
mpRandom.nextInt(max)              // Returns 0 to max-1 integer
```

### State Synchronization

#### Host Sends (serializeGameState)
```javascript
{
  players: [
    { id, x, y, hp, maxHp, weapon, isDowned, isReloading },  // Host
    { id, x, y, hp, maxHp, weapon, isDowned, isReloading }   // Guest
  ],
  enemies: [{ id, x, y, hp, type, vx, vy }],
  bullets: [{ id, x, y, vx, vy, isEnemy, isP2 }],
  loot: [{ id, x, y, type }],
  crates: [{ id, x, y }],
  level: number,
  roomId: number
}
```

#### Guest Sends (serializeLocalInput)
```javascript
{
  keys: { up, down, left, right, sprint },
  mouse: { x, y, down },
  actions: ['reload', 'grenade', 'interact', 'melee', 'switch']
}
```

### Player 2 Functions (Host Only)
```javascript
firePlayer2Bullet(targetX, targetY)  // Weapon-specific with fire rate
reloadPlayer2()                       // Reload with ammo consumption
hitPlayer2(damage, fromX, fromY)     // Damage with downed state
meleePlayer2(targetX, targetY)       // Melee attack
throwPlayer2Grenade(targetX, targetY) // Full grenade throw
interactPlayer2()                     // Crate/item interaction
openCratePlayer2(crate)              // Open crate
switchWeaponPlayer2()                // Cycle weapons
handlePlayer2Death()                  // Death handling
```

### Host-Only Game Logic
These run ONLY on host (guest receives results via state sync):
- Enemy spawning (`spawnRoomEntities` - enemies only)
- Enemy AI (`enemies.getChildren().forEach(e => e.update())`)
- Collision damage (bullet-enemy, bullet-player, enemy-player, acid-player)
- Loot spawning (`spawnLootSkull`)

### Guest Receives (applyHostState)
- Updates both player positions (P2 uses interpolation)
- Creates/updates/removes enemies dynamically
- Creates/updates/removes bullets
- Creates/removes loot skulls
- Destroys crates that host destroyed
- Room sync via `guestRoomSync()`

### Key Multiplayer Flags
```javascript
this.isMultiplayer  // True if in multiplayer mode
this.isHost         // True for host, false for guest
```

### Player 2 Stats Object
```javascript
this.player2Stats = {
  hp, maxHp, ammo, currentWeapon,
  scrap, credits, materials, grenades,
  hasShotgun, hasSMG, hasCrossbow, hasRifle,
  magazines: { pistol, shotgun, smg, crossbow, rifle },
